IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hdcla-developers`

-- Housing Developers (Control and Licensing) Act 1965, ss 2, 4, 7, 9, 10, 11(4), 12(3), 25, 27A and penalties -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_housing-developers-control-and-licensing-act-1965.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`director with a clean record` MEANS Person WITH
