#ASSERT `the person may hold a responsible position` `director of a wound-up developer with approval`

§ `penalties and s 27A`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `developing without a licence` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `calling itself a housing developer without a licence` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `breaching the Project Account rules` EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `disclosing buyers' particulars` EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `taking money from an anonymous source` EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `developing without a licence` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `breaching a licence condition` EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `failing to publish audited accounts` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for ignoring a direction including daily fines` 10 EQUALS 100000

#ASSERT `the maximum composition sum` `developing without a licence` EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the maximum composition sum` `obstructing a show-unit inspection` EQUALS 5000

